      "problem": "Simplify the expression $2.5x+2y-x+1.5y.$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we group the like terms.\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t2.5x+2y-x+1.5y &= \\[5pt]\n\t\t\\underbrace{2.5x-x}_{x \\textrm{ terms}}+\\underbrace{2y+1.5y}_{y \\textrm{ terms}} &\n\t}\n$$\n\nThen, we combine the like terms:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t\\underbrace{2.5x-x}+\\underbrace{2y+1.5y} &= \\[5pt]\n\t\t(2.5-1)x + (2+1.5)y &=\\[5pt]\n\t\t1.5x + 3.5y\n\t}\n$$",
